# Welcoming page photos

- Student role: every student model must look like a 6–9 year old child (early elementary),
  never teens or pre-teens. Applies to welcome-student-create, welcome-student-code,
  welcome-student-collab, and welcome-student-collab-kids.
- Each role shows its own models: educator = teacher, parent = parent with their child,
  university = university students, lecturer = lecturer with university students.
- Lighting: bright, neutral daylight with rich contrast and natural skin tones. No warm or
  brown cast, but never washed out or over-bright.
- Smartboards, whiteboards, and projector screens stay fully inside the frame with headroom
  above them.
- Images are 1280×720 JPEGs. Bump the `?v=` query in `WELCOME_ART` when one changes.
